  <Title>k__BackingField: "Module 1 Complete \u2014 Well Done"
  <Description>k__BackingField: Congratulations on completing the Order Picking module.
    You have learned how to read a pick list, navigate to a storage location, verify
    a product by SKU, pick the correct quantity, recover from a mis-pick error, and
    review your route for efficiency. These are the core skills of every picker on
    this floor. The habits you build now, verify before you pick, plan your route
    before you move, check your tote before you submit. This will make you a reliable
    and efficient member of the team. Proceed to your next module when you are ready.
